---
import Dev from '../layouts/Dev.astro';
import '../styles/artwork-gallery.css';
---
<Dev title="Social compositions">
  <h1>Social compositions</h1>
  <p>Start from a concept, not a folder of exports. Templates pair metadata-related native screens; previews are the composition SVG, and a PNG export is that same SVG rasterized.</p>
  <div class="gallery-filters">
    <label>Concept<input id="concept-search" type="search" placeholder="Wallet, social, themes..." /></label>
    <label>Phone count<select id="concept-count"><option value="">1-4 phones</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select></label>
    <label>Aspect ratio<select id="concept-ratio"><option value="">All ratios</option><option value="square">Square / 1:1</option><option value="portrait">Portrait / 4:5</option><option value="story">Story / 9:16</option><option value="landscape">Landscape / 1.9:1</option></select></label>
    <label>Subject<select id="concept-state"></select></label>
    <label>Layout<select id="concept-layout"></select></label>
    <label class="dev-check"><input id="gallery-ground" type="checkbox" /> Stand the phones on a lit ground</label>
    <label class="dev-check"><input id="gallery-draft" type="checkbox" /> Allow clearly labelled draft previews</label>
  </div>
  <p id="social-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Reading concepts and source captures...</p>
  <details id="social-editor">
    <summary>Composition editor</summary>
    <div class="social-editor">
      <form id="composition-form">
        <div class="dev-field"><label for="recipe-title">Recipe title</label><input id="recipe-title" maxlength="120" /></div>
        <div class="dev-field"><label for="headline">Headline</label><textarea id="headline" maxlength="180" rows="2"></textarea></div>
        <div class="dev-field"><label for="subtitle">Subtitle</label><textarea id="subtitle" maxlength="320" rows="3"></textarea></div>
        <div class="dev-field"><label for="footnote">Footnote (caveats and disclosures, set quietly at the foot)</label><textarea id="footnote" maxlength="160" rows="2"></textarea></div>
        <div class="editor-row">
          <label>Background<select id="background"><option value="charcoal">Charcoal</option><option value="forest">Forest</option><option value="paper">Paper</option><option value="black">Black</option></select></label>
          <label>Canvas<select id="canvas"></select></label>
        </div>
        <div class="editor-row"><label>Width<input id="canvas-width" type="number" min="320" max="2560" step="1" required /></label><label>Height<input id="canvas-height" type="number" min="320" max="2560" step="1" required /></label></div>
        <label class="dev-field">Phone arrangement<select id="preset"></select></label>
        <div class="editor-row">
          <label>Brand watermark<select id="brand-placement"></select></label>
          <label>Lockup<select id="brand-lockup"></select></label>
          <label>Logo size<input id="brand-scale" type="number" min="0.6" max="1.6" step="0.05" /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="editor-row">
          <label>Ground<select id="shadow-ground"></select></label>
          <label>Height above it<input id="shadow-height" type="number" min="0" max="1.5" step="0.05" /></label>
          <label>Light softness<input id="shadow-softness" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="editor-row">
          <label>Shadow strength<input id="shadow-opacity" type="number" min="0" max="0.9" step="0.05" /></label>
          <label>Light direction<input id="shadow-angle" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="1" /></label>
          <label>Light tilt<input id="shadow-tilt" type="number" min="0" max="70" step="1" /></label>
        </div>
        <p class="dev-note">The ground is a real plane the phones rest on or hover above, lit by one directional source: each shadow is that light's exact projection of the chassis, so contact stays sharp, height softens it, and the throw is the height times the tangent of the light's tilt.</p>
        <div id="phone-controls"></div>
        <label class="dev-check"><input id="recipe-draft" type="checkbox" /> Allow outdated / unverified sources as a labelled draft</label>
        <div class="source-actions"><button type="button" id="export-recipe">Export recipe JSON</button></div>
        <label class="dev-field">Import recipe JSON<input type="file" id="import-recipe" accept="application/json,.json" /></label>
        <p class="dev-note">Edits are saved in this URL's hash, not to disk, and the preview follows them as you type. Imported recipes are validated before use; they cannot select arbitrary files or URLs.</p>
      </form>
      <section class="composition-output" aria-label="Final composition preview">
        <p id="render-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Rendering the first template...</p>
        <div id="composition-preview" class="composition-preview" data-stale="true"><p>No image rendered yet.</p></div>
        <button type="button" id="download-composition" class="dev-action" hidden>Download PNG</button>
        <details><summary>Render provenance</summary><pre id="composition-provenance">No render yet.</pre></details>
      </section>
    </div>
  </details>
  <h2>Concept gallery</h2>
  <p>Only visible templates render. Missing sources stay visible as capture requests, never replacement images.</p>
  <div id="concept-gallery" class="concept-gallery"></div>
  <noscript>This local editor needs JavaScript and the site dev server. It never runs native captures or writes generated images.</noscript>
</Dev>
<script>
  import { mountCompositionEditor } from '../../scripts/composition-editor.mjs';
  mountCompositionEditor();
</script>
